==Battleground==
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~25.33 seconds<sup>600f~760f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 50.67~65.33 seconds<sup>1,520f~1,960f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 34.67~42.67 seconds<sup>1,040f~1,280f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 17.33~21.33 seconds<sup>520f~640f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 24~30 seconds<sup>720f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

